--- !u!1001 &237349632
PrefabInstance:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  serializedVersion: 2
  m_Modification:
    serializedVersion: 3
    m_TransformParent: {fileID: 0}
    m_Modifications:
    - target: {fileID: 2042843277735502377, guid: 167daec4c2dd3a14bb403baa5190c050,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_Name
      value: Interactable Letter (1)
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2654585975503658956, guid: 167daec4c2dd3a14bb403baa5190c050,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: _pageTexts.Array.size
      value: 2
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2654585975503658956, guid: 167daec4c2dd3a14bb403baa5190c050,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: _pageTexts.Array.data[0]
      value: 'November 11th 1927.


        We found something. The missing man kept
        a journal and well...


        He''s completely insane, his writings start
        off sane but by the end of his entries he''s rambling about being beckoned
        to the devil''s strait by a voice in his head.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2654585975503658956, guid: 167daec4c2dd3a14bb403baa5190c050,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: _pageTexts.Array.data[1]
      value: 'I''m starting to understand why that old man was brought along with
        us.


        None of us but him could make heads or tails of the strange
        ranting from the journal.


        I just hope he doesn''t let it go to
        his head.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 9066643239372199602, guid: 167daec4c2dd3a14bb403baa5190c050,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_LocalPosition.x
      value: -13.554354
